                <pb facs="0843" n="755" xml:id="pg755"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. McCormick.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-08-09"><hi rendition="#italic">August 9,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay informs Mr. McCormick that according to press reports the Russian prize
                    court has confiscated all the cargo of the <hi rendition="#italic">Arabia</hi>
                    consigned to Japanese ports. Instructs him to ascertain and report to the
                    Department substance of the decision.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
